<h1>Phixem</h1>
<p>
  Hello world. Each visit to this page is stored in SQLite and replicated to Azure Blob
  with Litestream. After the container scales to zero, the next request should still
  list every previous load time.
</p>
<p class="muted">{length(@page_loads)} load(s) recorded.</p>
<ol>
  <li :for={{load, index} <- Enum.with_index(@page_loads, 1)} class={if index == length(@page_loads), do: "this"}>
    {Calendar.strftime(load.inserted_at, "%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S UTC")}
    <span :if={index == length(@page_loads)} class="this"> — this request</span>
  </li>
</ol>
